      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Yes. Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu at Sensei Sandy BJJ is safe for beginners. Training begins with a studio tour, a safety walkthrough, and clear rule",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 235.46875,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 2021.578125,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu is a grappling martial art based on leverage, balance, and body position rather than striking. At our Tannersville studi",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 353.203125,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 2269.046875,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Children can start Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu at age 5 at Sensei Sandy BJJ. Our Youth classes welcome kids ages 5 to 9, and our Teen classes serve ",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 235.46875,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 2791.03125,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "For kids ages 5 to 9, classes focus on body awareness, coordination, following coach directions, and working respectfully with a partner. We",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 282.5625,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 3038.5,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "You can start Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu at any fitness level. Training is how you build stamina, strength, and mobility. Classes begin with calm, ",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 211.921875,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 3489.84375,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "Adults of all backgrounds and body types train at Sensei Sandy BJJ. We prioritize leverage and technique over brute force. You can pause, re",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 211.921875,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 3713.765625,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Your first visit begins with a 15-minute room tour and conversation with Coach Sandy. You see the clean mats, learn studio safety rules, and",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 259.015625,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4094.46875,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "You will experience pure encouragement and cooperative learning from day one. You wear comfortable athletic clothes. Coach Sandy introduces ",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 329.65625,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4365.484375,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Start with a visit. Meet the coach and watch a class. Look for small class sizes, so the coach can see every student and give clear steps. L",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 259.015625,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4185.25,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "At Sensei Sandy BJJ, classes are capped at 12 students, and Sandy coaches every class himself. Your first visit is free. You can watch first",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 188.375,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4456.265625,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Beginners progress best by training 2 to 3 times per week. This rhythm gives your body adequate time to recover while reinforcing new moveme",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 188.375,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4276.03125,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "Consistency matters more than intensity. Attending two or three small-group classes each week allows techniques to feel natural and comforta",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 282.5625,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4476.40625,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Yes. Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu builds genuine confidence through earned accomplishment. By learning how to escape holds, protect their balance, an",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 235.46875,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4387.203125,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "Unlike activities based on rote memorization, Jiu-Jitsu gives children tangible feedback in real time. They see their progress as they learn",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 306.109375,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4634.671875,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "You can take Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu classes at Sensei Sandy BJJ, located at 6045 Main Street (2nd Floor Studio) in Tannersville, NY. The studio",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 235.46875,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4498.375,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "We are located right on Main Street in Tannersville, inside Studios on Main, with ample street parking nearby. We offer dedicated classes fo",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 329.65625,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4745.84375,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Wear clean, comfortable athletic clothing, such as a t-shirt or rash guard and athletic shorts or sweatpants. Choose clothing free of zipper",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 188.375,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4589.15625,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "You train in bare feet on clean mats. We recommend bringing a water bottle and slip-on shoes or flip-flops to wear off the mat. We provide l",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 164.828125,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4789.53125,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Yes. Parents and guardians are always welcome to watch small-group youth classes from comfortable matside seating. Staying to observe helps ",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 188.375,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4679.9375,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "We encourage parents to observe how Coach Sandy leads drills and pairs students. You can see how we handle pacing, safety, and encouragement",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 188.375,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4880.3125,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "The first visit is free. Your first class is free too \u2014 for adults, kids, and teens. Sandy confirms the class first.",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 94.1875,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4770.71875,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "Meet Sandy and tour the studio. Try coached movement before you pick a plan. After your first class, Sandy shares membership options so you ",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 164.828125,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4876.90625,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Yes. We make rescheduling simple and personal. You can coordinate makeups or change your class times by sending a text directly to Sandy at ",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 141.28125,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4861.5,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "We understand mountain weather, family events, and busy work schedules. Our open-seat text coordination helps you maintain training consiste",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 164.828125,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 5014.78125,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Sensei Sandy BJJ teaches Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu. BJJ is the foundational ground control and submission discipline used in modern MMA.",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 117.734375,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 4972.671875,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "Our Tannersville studio focuses purely on safe, cooperative grappling, positional balance, and gentle joint control. You learn practical sel",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 164.828125,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 5102.40625,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "direct-answer fw-semibold text-dark mb-2",
      "text": "Sensei Sandy (Sandy Jos\u00e9 N\u00fa\u00f1ez) is the founder and head coach of Sensei Sandy BJJ in Tannersville, NY. He is a first-degree Brazilian Jiu-Ji",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 211.921875,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 5083.84375,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "text-muted mb-3",
      "text": "Sandy has practiced martial arts since 2010 with thousands of hours coaching youth, teens, and adult beginners. A Greene County resident liv",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 226,
      "height": 306.109375,
      "x": 85,
      "y": 5307.765625,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Every student learns tapping and reset rules before participating in partner drills.",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 206,
      "height": 88.3125,
      "x": 101,
      "y": 5391.109375,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Beginners are paired with experienced, calm practitioners who emphasize controlled technique.",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 206,
      "height": 88.3125,
      "x": 101,
      "y": 5574.15625,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Resistance is calibrated gradually. You focus on positions and escapes at a manageable pace.",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 206,
      "height": 88.3125,
      "x": 101,
      "y": 5757.203125,
      "href": null
    },
    {
      "tag": "P",
      "id": "",
      "classes": "",
      "text": "Need to adjust a session? Reschedule your class easily by sending Sandy a direct text message.",
      "font": 14.72,
      "width": 206,
      "height": 88.3125,
      "x": 101,
      "y": 5940.25,
      "href": null
    },
